content.text:
id: char-maya
name: maya
sketch: Maya Alvarez, 25, EMT trainee. Calm, medically knowledgeable, morally
  determined to keep people alive. She survives the escape.
identity: {}
provenance: {}

id: char-otto
name: otto
sketch: Otto Beck, 67, retired high-school teacher. World-weary, kind,
  physically fragile but mentally sharp. He does not survive the outbreak.
identity: {}
provenance: {}

id: char-lina
name: lina
sketch: Lina Beck, 16, Otto's granddaughter. Brash and quick, still learning
  restraint. She is caught out in a panic and is killed during the escape.
identity: {}
provenance: {}

