{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"The pump had no mains power; they siphoned fuel from the underground tank into cans. The red jerry can on the seat was roughly six liters of fuel when they finished.","participants":["char-ellie","char-dan","char-lina"],"location":"loc-gas-station"}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"The pump kept clicking and spitting; power at the station is out and the pump is dead. Siphoning was used.","participants":["loc-gas-station"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"Dan's pickup started on the second try. Truck stereo is dead; battery is weak but will start the engine once or twice.","participants":["obj-truck","char-dan"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"Handheld radio received an intermittent transmission: '— get to the highway. Move. Highway clear—' before breaking to static. The handheld had intermittent bursts of signal; the truck stereo was dead.","participants":["obj-radio"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"The map is marked 'OLD BRIDGE — WEIGHT LIMIT'; county detour adds ~25 minutes and crosses the rail yard. Otto advises avoiding the bridge if possible.","participants":["loc-old-bridge","char-otto","char-dan"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"Group decision and plan: load truck, aim to reach the highway before dark, debate over route and tactics (use radio as bait vs. fast low travel).","participants":["char-ellie","char-dan","char-maya","char-otto","char-lina"],"location":null}
{"scene":"s-001","when":"scene s-001","summary":"They load the truck and depart the gas station, agreeing to 'get to the highway before dark'. The pickup starts on the second try and drives off.","participants":["char-ellie","char-dan","char-lina","char-maya","char-otto"],"location":"loc-gas-station"}

